WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:09.551
[Alexandra] Are you sure
he's gonna be here?

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:10.635
[giggles]

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:12.721
As long as there's a worthy competition…

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:14.764
He'll never miss a race.

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:16.558
Just make sure you don't forget our deal.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.476
[giggles]
Don't worry about us.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.020
Just keep your eye on the road.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.398
And make sure to have our prize
at the finish line.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.027
[engine roars]

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.195
[brakes squeak]

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.407
Eh, you up for a race?

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.659
It depends.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.244
You up for a challenge?

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.288
Haven't turned one down yet.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:40.498
Winner gets a trophy.

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.500
[snickers]

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.377
Haven't heard that in a while.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:46.254
You'll have to win first.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:49.591
[engine revs]

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:51.926
Ready, set…

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:55.930
[tires screech]

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:02.020
[engines roaring]

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.148
[upbeat music]

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.279
[clanks]

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.453
[engines revving]

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.790
[clicking]

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:24.334
[engines revving]

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:30.632
[engines roaring]

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:42.685
[high-pitched humming]

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.399
[panting]

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:51.736
[tense music]

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.827
[galloping]

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:00.703
Anytime you're ready, girls.

00:02:01.663 --> 00:02:03.706
Then you better hold on to your hairdo.

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:06.084
'Cause once we go,
there's no turning back.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:07.418
Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:08.670
Now!

00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:14.050
[engine roars]

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:18.429
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:02:18.513 --> 00:02:19.848
[cheering]

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:22.016
[hooves clopping]

